Z||000000||Julian||11-22-2000||02:21 PM||||Anyone have any problems buying a Fiero in the US & bringing it into Canada? Let's hear some experiences. <P>My problem was the custom officer does not believe me that it's a Fiero. They think it's a kit & kits (built) are not allowed in the country. Apparently they say kits are not crash worthy. <P>When I told them mine was a Pontiac option they laughed at me. Oh well it's just a matter of time till I can get the proper paperwork....for now it's in my garage but with no proper paperwork for licensing.<P>I guess I'll just restore it for a while.<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/meralogo.gif"> ||||reg||6
